Z||000000||87GTZ34||05-03-2001||10:02 PM||||on the rear passenger side between the battery box and the outer shell?  I didn't have time to trace them but it had two steel lines coming out of it.  I happened to look there to see what was in the way when I put the side scoops on it and sure enough something is in the way.  I have an '87 GT and the GM manual doesn't reference it anywhere (not surprising though, they were short of headcount on that project).<P>TIA||||reg||5
